  Title: Researchers have created the first complete map showing how hundreds of mutations in a key cancer gene affect tumor growth.
  Source: ScienceDaily
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/02/260204121540.htm
  category: research
  importance: 95
  ai_summary: "A comprehensive map reveals how hundreds of cancer gene mutations impact tumor development, with some having minimal effect while others significantly accelerate growth, offering insights for targeted therapies."
  Title: New nasal vaccine shows strong protection against H5N1 bird flu
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/02/260204114343.htm
  category: research
  importance: 90
  ai_summary: "A nasal spray vaccine demonstrated strong protection against H5N1 bird flu in animal studies, potentially offering a crucial tool to prevent the spread of this emerging infectious disease."
  Title: The overlooked nutrition risk of Ozempic and Wegovy
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/02/260203030551.htm
  category: research
  importance: 85
  ai_summary: "Users of weight-loss drugs like Ozempic and Wegovy may be at risk of nutritional deficiencies due to insufficient guidance on diet, highlighting a critical area for patient management."
