  Title: A 25-year study found an unexpected link between cheese and dementia
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/02/260203030540.htm
  category: research
  importance: 75
  ai_summary: "A long-term study suggests full-fat dairy, particularly cheese, may be associated with a lower risk of dementia in individuals without genetic Alzheimer's risk, challenging traditional dietary advice."
